The problem
Many of our learners finish A1 German and book their Goethe or ÖSD exam without
knowing if they are ready. Some fail and lose both their exam fee and precious time on
their journey abroad. Website link - https://www.globio.ai/
This is a real problem we care about, and we want to see how you would solve it.

Part 1: Build
Build a small web app where a learner takes a short check of 10–15 questions across
vocabulary, grammar and reading. After the check, the app should tell the learner:
How ready they are, broken down by skill.
The 2–3 things they should practise before booking the exam.
You decide how "ready" is calculated. Host the app on a public link and share the code on
GitHub. Any tech stack or tools are fine.